{"id":"composer_000013","name":"安东尼奥·维瓦尔第","originalName":"Antonio Vivaldi","aliases":["维瓦尔第","安东尼奥·卢奇奥·维瓦尔第","Antonio Lucio Vivaldi","Vivaldi"],"birthYear":1678,"deathYear":1741,"nationality":"意大利","period":"巴洛克","introduction":"意大利巴洛克作曲家、小提琴家，绰号\"红发神父\"。他确立了独奏协奏曲的形式，快—慢—快三乐章结构与 ritornello 手法经他定型并影响深远，一生写下五百余首协奏曲，同时是威尼斯皮耶塔女子音乐学校的音乐指导。代表作有《四季》、歌剧与大量宗教音乐。","styleSummary":"旋律明快、节奏富有动力，独奏与乐队交替的协奏语汇生动外向。","completeness":"complete","status":"published","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T12:00:00.000Z","sources":[{"id":"wikipedia-en-antonio-vivaldi","title":"Antonio Vivaldi","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antonio_Vivaldi","publisher":"English Wikipedia","accessedAt":"2026-08-27","supports":["name","birthYear","deathYear","nationality","period","introduction"]}],"works":[{"id":"work_000037","composerId":"composer_000013","composerName":"安东尼奥·维瓦尔第","title":"《四季》","originalTitle":"Le quattro stagioni, Op. 8","opus":"Op. 8","genre":"小提琴协奏曲集","periodKey":"baroque","genreFamily":"concerto","durationMinutes":42,"difficulty":"第一次听","tags":["维瓦尔第","巴洛克","小提琴协奏曲","标题音乐","意大利"],"summary":"1725年出版的四部小提琴协奏曲，各附一首十四行诗，把春雷、酷暑、收获与寒冬写成巴洛克标题音乐中最深入人心的名篇。","upcomingEventIds":["perf_00730c5d2c688944","perf_b4511f5351415e40"],"upcomingEventCount":2}],"upcomingEventIds":["perf_00730c5d2c688944","perf_b4511f5351415e40"],"upcomingEventCount":2}